  "goodToKnow": "Das Fleckchen is a little spot or patch, a diminutive of der Fleck. The idiom ein schönes Fleckchen Erde means a lovely little place, beloved of travel writing. Der Fleck means stain or spot and also place: nicht vom Fleck kommen (to make no progress), am falschen Fleck. The suffix -chen makes nouns neuter. The plural is the same."
